ly">we are positioned to serve the global market efficiently</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Whether you are a top-tier international brand or a growing SME">Whether you are a top-tier international brand or a growing SME</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="we provide stable">we provide stable</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="reliable">reliable</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="and cost-effective ingredient solutions tailored to your needs">and cost-effective ingredient solutions tailored to your needs</span>.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/营业执照_001.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-233" style="width:400px" title="Sobre nóse BatatatroBatatas fritas congeladas" width="7016" height="4960" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="DinWeys Business License">DinWeys Business License</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column has-medium-font-size is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Company Verification Statement">Company Verification Statement</span> </strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Company Name">Company Name</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co.">Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co.</span>, Ltd.<br><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Unified Social Credit Code">Unified Social Credit Code</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source=